commit 2567e6430349b02a500a1a29d40d1c3a351b7068
Author: ledger <ledger@example.invalid>
Date:   Mon Nov 23 01:57:29 2026 +0000

    Add a tasks board for the committee
    
    Builds boards/tasks from the task sheet export (incoming/tasks.csv, copied
    unedited). Instead of the events board's sections, tasks are grouped by when
    they're due: overdue, due by the next Thursday meeting, later; done jobs fold
    away (asked for on 12 Nov). The polytunnel rota columns of the same sheet are
    shown first, from the current week on (Dot's request in the water-meter thread).
    
    Kit changes, events board output unchanged apart from one CSS rule:
    - a "due" section mode and optional "rota" in board.json
    - columns can format dates and take a prefix
    - status is matched case-insensitively (the export has "Done" and "done")
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

